#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""tools/catalogue [--previous FILE] [--out FILE] [--only ID,...]: the components catalogue (docs/api.md, Components)
from each upstream's releases, every download pinned by its sha256. GITHUB_TOKEN lifts GitHub's rate limit."""

